#EXTM3U
# Curated local channels for the Lancaster / Harrisburg / Lebanon / York market
# (the Susquehanna Valley in south-central Pennsylvania), starting with WGAL 8,
# the NBC affiliate licensed to Lancaster.
#
# Every URL in this file is a publicly listed feed that is re-checked end to end by
# scripts/scraper.py on every run, exactly like playlists/sources/ae-networks.m3u and
# playlists/sources/priority-channels.m3u: a feed that stops answering is dropped from
# the published playlists automatically, and one that answers without media is caught
# by the nightly deep check (playlists/checks/LINK-CHECK.md).
#
# Adding a channel here also adds it to PremiumTV.m3u, PremiumTV_all.m3u and
# playlists/countries/USA.m3u on the next scrape, and its tvg-id is what the merged
# guide build (EPG/PremiumTV.xml) matches against the upstream guides.
